---
title: Chewy peanut butter cookies
tags: [gluten-free, quick]
source: Chewy Peanut Butter Cookies by Simple by Cindy, https://simplebycindyblog.com/chewy-peanut-butter-cookie
---

Heat the oven to 350°F. Line two #half sheet pans{} with parchment.

In a #large bowl{}, beat the @peanut butter{1%cup}, @light brown sugar{1/2%cup}(packed) and @granulated sugar{1/2%cup} together with a wooden spoon.

Beat in the @egg{1}, @baking soda{1%tsp}, @vanilla extract{1%tsp} and @kosher salt{1/4%tsp}.

Roll into 1-ounce balls, set 8 on each pan and press flat with a fork.

Bake ~{10%minutes}, until dry-looking and just lightly browned. Leave on the pans ~{2%minutes} before moving.
